  "question": {
    "text": "Five equal resistance, each of resistance \\(\\mathrm{R}\\), are connected as shown in figure below. A battery of \\(\\mathrm{V}\\) volt is connected between \\(A\\) and \\(B\\). The current flowing in \\(\\mathrm{FC}\\) will be\n<img src=\"assets\\qt0040_3776c777c9ee.png\"><br>"
