  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: <img src=\"assets\\st0040_128d0523e28a.png\"><br>\n\\(\\mathrm{I}=\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{\\mathrm{R}} \\therefore \\text { Current in } \\mathrm{FC}=\\frac{\\mathrm{I}}{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{2 \\mathrm{R}}\\)"
